Regarding PDP's and environment problems...

I once had a PDP 11/84 in a computer room with windows to the
outside. During one winter storm, one of the windows was blown
open during the night. An operatior noticed this in the morning
and closed the window. No problems so far with the PDP...

Now, when the window was open, the temp in the computer room
got below 0 deg C (freezing point) and the water based 
