> on a two-byte basis, and four-byte numbers must be byte-
> reversed on a four-byte basis, etc.  The system doesn't
> know enough about each application's declarations or
> methods to know how to parse and reverse each part.
>

 The system doesn't, but the RTL may very well know. See above.
 
