I'll believe this one when I see it.  I just came off a 3 year contract at a
major manufacturer's site in North Eastern Ohio.  We had a pretty good mix
of boxes, Compaqs, HP 9000 Unix machines, Dells, IBMs, and the only
consistent backup media format was DLT.  Never seen so many DLT drives in my
life.  And I dealt with 3 other international locations of theirs that all
specifically requested DLT drives with any new hardware.

