intermediate disk groups, you must 'unstack them'

If you want to do so, you need to write manually on a paper, what and
where are the disk groups, delete every DG on top of stack ( letters
GT group to delete ). At this point to protect the strategic disks
from disk groups deleted, put them failed, recreate existing structure
and force disks to be optimal.

If you're on your 1st try, make a backup first :-)


