...

> Operating under the assumption that Marvel did get a taste o' the Taliban,
> and further assuming that the plug was not concurrently pulled on VMS,
> Hewlett-PAQard would have hope that Wildfire technology could sustain the
OS
> until the 2004-2005 availability of IPF-Inside Blade and switched fabric
> systems.
>
