> I'm not sure whether this is the source of your problem but I remember
> that I once also had problems with cxx's template instantiaton. I wanted
> to link a library to my C++ program and I also got messages similar to
> your messages. The problem was that the library and the program did not
> use the same cxx_repository directory. Are you sure that you always use
> the same cxx_repository ? You can control it with the -ptr flag.
